A plate-only harness with a 1000D Cordura shell, 210D HT Cordura lining, and 20mm lumbar pad. The Standard size fits GORUCK 10, 20, and 30 lb plates. The current listing also offers Long and Heavy versions: the Long takes a 30 or 45 lb Long plate, and the Heavy has two Long pockets.

