GORUCK's Normandy Events 2026 marked the 82nd anniversary of D-Day with rucks and challenges in Normandy, France, in early June 2026. They were announced months before the Spring Sweat Sale. For most ruckers the trip was aspirational, while the sale's discounts were the part with wider use.

