The Spring Sweat Sale has ended, so compare current prices rather than waiting for a repeat. Buy early enough to train in the gear you'll use on the day. Our 8-week fall event countdown covers the gear shakedown timeline, and the Labor Day sale page covers what we found when checking for a holiday discount.

GORUCK accepts returns within 30 days of delivery for items in original, unused condition, and Final Sale items can't be returned. The SCARS Lifetime Guarantee is separate: GORUCK says it will repair or replace gear worn out or damaged through use, with listed exclusions. Check both policies on GORUCK's site before buying.

